OL,3,GNEWSADemolition of city centre car park
OL,4,Abegins
OL,5,
OL,6,FDemolition work has started on a
OL,7,Fmulti-storey car park in Nottingham
OL,8,Fcity centre.
OL,10,FThe NCP car park in Maid Marian Way is
OL,11,Fbeing torn down as part of the wider
OL,12,Fredevelopment of the Broad Marsh area
OL,13,Fof the city.
OL,15,FTraffic restrictions in the area have
OL,16,Fcaused disruption, with warnings of
OL,17,F"severe congestion" for drivers.
OL,19,FOn Monday, diversions in place ahead of
OL,20,Fthe demolition led to delays for bus
OL,21,Fand tram services in the city.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
